\begin_layout Standard
The inheritance now reads in the same direction as the mathematics:
 every group is a monoid,
 every monoid is a semigroup,
 and every semigroup is a magma.
 The converse does not follow,
 because possessing an operation does not establish the laws required by the stronger structures.
\end_layout

